text = "WASD: Move Commander | Space: Dodge (i-frame) | Q: Battle Cry
• Grunt: Prioritizes Barricade before Ground Tower, ignores Wall Tower.
• Archer: Stops at 11m, parabolic arrow bypasses Barricade, dodgeable.
• Brute: 250 HP, heads straight to Fortress, knockback immune.
• Stagger: Attack Grunt/Archer in wind-up (0.4s) -> interrupts + 2s immunity."

